          "preconditions": [],
          "description": "Use food-grade baking soda and ordinary food vinegar only. Work in an open, stable bowl of at least 500 mL on a tray; never seal the vessel. Avoid eyes, do not taste the experimental mixture, and keep children/pets away. Gather a scale with 0.01 g resolution, thermometer, 50 mL measuring vessel, small powder cup, spoon and timer."
